      Class | Type | Series | Point | Value | Change | Time | Age
      Interest Rate | ir_swap | USD SOFR fwd 0D | 1Y | 4.0488 | +0.0002 | 11:30:00.412 | 0.2s
      Interest Rate | ir_swap | USD SOFR fwd 0D | 5Y | 4.1533 | +0.0006 | 11:29:59.904 | 0.7s
      Interest Rate | ir_swap | USD SOFR fwd 0D | 10Y | 4.2201 | 0.0000 | 11:29:58.120 | 2.5s
    }
  }
  --
  {#
    <b>All quotes: USD SOFR fwd 0D 5Y</b> | Value | To the mid | Age
    bloomberg | 4.1533 | +0.0003 | 0.7s
    tradeweb | 4.1520 | -0.0010 | 1.2s
    ice | 4.1537 | +0.0007 | 14m
